fastino/gliner2
https://huggingface.co/fastino
Reference model and preprocessing (schema-prompt format) that the v2 and
Candle backends implement. The reference implementation is
https://github.com/fastino-ai/GLiNER2 (Apache-2.0). No code from it is
included, except that the v2 word-splitter regular expression is the same
pattern as its gliner2/processing/word_splitter.py (see ATTRIBUTIONS.md,
section "GLiNER2 ONNX engine"). Weights are not distributed with this crate.
